// Melee weapons. Schema: zombye_sim::items::WeaponDef (validated on load).
//
// Zombies have about 100 hit points (85-115). Distances in metres (range is measured to the
// zombie's body), times in seconds, chances and endurance in 0..1. Endurance below half makes
// swings slower and weaker; walking gives back 0.05 a second, so endurance_cost / swing_seconds
// above that wears you down (about ten seconds of flat-out bat swinging). All numbers are our
// own, tuned for feel and readability:
//   knives   fast, short, one target, crit-happy (go for the back)
//   blunt    short ones stagger, long ones sweep a wide arc, hit several and knock down
//   axes     slow, heavy, tiring; two hits or one good one
// Exactly one weapon must be Unarmed: what a player swings with empty hands (never placed).
// `skill` is the skill it trains and that makes it better (#46), by how it hits: Bludgeon for blunt
// weapons, Edged for knives and axes, Brawl for bare hands. Every weapon of a category names the
// same one; left out, it is the category's.
